{"5367330":{"success":true,"data":{"type":"game","name":"Horde Lab","steam_appid":5367330,"required_age":0,"is_free":false,"dlc":[5393610,5371460],"detailed_description":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Build the maze. Annihilate the horde.<\/h2>Horde Lab is a tower defense where YOU decide the path. Place walls anywhere and the horde will always look for an open route: stretch it out, drag it under your towers' fire and watch thousands of enemies crash against your maze.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5367330\/extras\/41b5e37a8683d58b5b09ab8adee9fc47.poster.avif?t=1793641576\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5367330\/extras\/41b5e37a8683d58b5b09ab8adee9fc47.webm?t=1793641576\" type=\"video\/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5367330\/extras\/41b5e37a8683d58b5b09ab8adee9fc47.mp4?t=1793641576\" type=\"video\/mp4\"><\/video><\/span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Thousands of enemies at once<\/h2>Rivers of enemies, knockback, chain explosions, lightning, fire and vortexes. And when a missile lands on the thickest part of the horde... time stands still.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5367330\/extras\/3f5ed55e50163658b9bbb767ed442815.poster.avif?t=1793641576\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5367330\/extras\/3f5ed55e50163658b9bbb767ed442815.webm?t=1793641576\" type=\"video\/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5367330\/extras\/3f5ed55e50163658b9bbb767ed442815.mp4?t=1793641576\" type=\"video\/mp4\"><\/video><\/span><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5367330\/extras\/6604543bc615701523ae5767526b05d5.poster.avif?t=1793641576\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5367330\/extras\/6604543bc615701523ae5767526b05d5.webm?t=1793641576\" type=\"video\/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5367330\/extras\/6604543bc615701523ae5767526b05d5.mp4?t=1793641576\" type=\"video\/mp4\"><\/video><\/span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >3 vs 3 online<\/h2>Team up with two friends (or fill the seats with bots) and take on three other players online through Steam. Everyone raises a base, sends troops that level up and unleashes bosses with abilities. Coordinate purges, cover your allies and tear down the rival bases. With lobbies, team and all chat, and a wins leaderboard.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5367330\/extras\/69803ba6dbd4b8c7e69e72cff82927ce.poster.avif?t=1793641576\" width=720 height=404 ><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5367330\/extras\/69803ba6dbd4b8c7e69e72cff82927ce.webm?t=1793641576\" type=\"video\/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5367330\/extras\/69803ba6dbd4b8c7e69e72cff82927ce.mp4?t=1793641576\" type=\"video\/mp4\"><\/video><\/span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Every run is different<\/h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>A new map every run<\/strong>, with gates that open as you progress.<br><\/li><li><strong>Cards every wave<\/strong>: choose from common to mythic upgrades and build a different combo every time.<br><\/li><li><strong>A boss at the end of every wave<\/strong>, with random abilities and auras... and some of them steal your cards.<\/li><\/ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >A 562-upgrade skill tree<\/h2>Every run earns points for the skill tree: unlock towers, upgrade them and pick unique special abilities. The more you play, the further you get.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5367330\/extras\/3f141a16f7c6ac52a5dbd84fe1f41f9f.poster.avif?t=1793641576\" width=616 height=318 ><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5367330\/extras\/3f141a16f7c6ac52a5dbd84fe1f41f9f.webm?t=1793641576\" type=\"video\/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5367330\/extras\/3f141a16f7c6ac52a5dbd84fe1f41f9f.mp4?t=1793641576\" type=\"video\/mp4\"><\/video><\/span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features<\/h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>15 buildings: machine gun, shotgun, sniper, flamethrower, tesla, laser, mortar, missile launcher, seismic hammer, vortex, amplifier, gold mine, workshop, bastion and walls.<br><\/li><li>7 enemy types, elites with auras and a boss every wave.<br><\/li><li>Endless waves: the horde never stops.<br><\/li><li><strong>3 vs 3<\/strong>: you and two allies against three rivals, with troops that level up, bosses with abilities and fog of war. Plus two minigames: <strong>Color War<\/strong> (your towers paint the enemy's ground) and <strong>Conquest<\/strong> (enclose territory with your creature).<br><\/li><li>Adaptive music that rises with the battle.<br><\/li><li>74 achievements.<br><\/li><li>Playable tutorial, 4 game speeds and manual slow motion.<br><\/li><li>10 languages, rebindable keys, controller support and accessibility options (text size, colorblind filters, fewer flashes).<\/li><\/ul>","about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Build the maze. Annihilate the horde.<\/h2>Horde Lab is a tower defense where YOU decide the path. Place walls anywhere and the horde will always look for an open route: stretch it out, drag it under your towers' fire and watch thousands of enemies crash against your maze.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5367330\/extras\/41b5e37a8683d58b5b09ab8adee9fc47.poster.avif?t=1793641576\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5367330\/extras\/41b5e37a8683d58b5b09ab8adee9fc47.webm?t=1793641576\" type=\"video\/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5367330\/extras\/41b5e37a8683d58b5b09ab8adee9fc47.mp4?t=1793641576\" type=\"video\/mp4\"><\/video><\/span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Thousands of enemies at once<\/h2>Rivers of enemies, knockback, chain explosions, lightning, fire and vortexes. And when a missile lands on the thickest part of the horde... time stands still.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5367330\/extras\/3f5ed55e50163658b9bbb767ed442815.poster.avif?t=1793641576\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5367330\/extras\/3f5ed55e50163658b9bbb767ed442815.webm?t=1793641576\" type=\"video\/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5367330\/extras\/3f5ed55e50163658b9bbb767ed442815.mp4?t=1793641576\" type=\"video\/mp4\"><\/video><\/span><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5367330\/extras\/6604543bc615701523ae5767526b05d5.poster.avif?t=1793641576\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5367330\/extras\/6604543bc615701523ae5767526b05d5.webm?t=1793641576\" type=\"video\/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5367330\/extras\/6604543bc615701523ae5767526b05d5.mp4?t=1793641576\" type=\"video\/mp4\"><\/video><\/span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >3 vs 3 online<\/h2>Team up with two friends (or fill the seats with bots) and take on three other players online through Steam. Everyone raises a base, sends troops that level up and unleashes bosses with abilities. Coordinate purges, cover your allies and tear down the rival bases. With lobbies, team and all chat, and a wins leaderboard.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5367330\/extras\/69803ba6dbd4b8c7e69e72cff82927ce.poster.avif?t=1793641576\" width=720 height=404 ><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5367330\/extras\/69803ba6dbd4b8c7e69e72cff82927ce.webm?t=1793641576\" type=\"video\/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5367330\/extras\/69803ba6dbd4b8c7e69e72cff82927ce.mp4?t=1793641576\" type=\"video\/mp4\"><\/video><\/span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Every run is different<\/h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>A new map every run<\/strong>, with gates that open as you progress.<br><\/li><li><strong>Cards every wave<\/strong>: choose from common to mythic upgrades and build a different combo every time.<br><\/li><li><strong>A boss at the end of every wave<\/strong>, with random abilities and auras... and some of them steal your cards.<\/li><\/ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >A 562-upgrade skill tree<\/h2>Every run earns points for the skill tree: unlock towers, upgrade them and pick unique special abilities. The more you play, the further you get.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5367330\/extras\/3f141a16f7c6ac52a5dbd84fe1f41f9f.poster.avif?t=1793641576\" width=616 height=318 ><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5367330\/extras\/3f141a16f7c6ac52a5dbd84fe1f41f9f.webm?t=1793641576\" type=\"video\/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5367330\/extras\/3f141a16f7c6ac52a5dbd84fe1f41f9f.mp4?t=1793641576\" type=\"video\/mp4\"><\/video><\/span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features<\/h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>15 buildings: machine gun, shotgun, sniper, flamethrower, tesla, laser, mortar, missile launcher, seismic hammer, vortex, amplifier, gold mine, workshop, bastion and walls.<br><\/li><li>7 enemy types, elites with auras and a boss every wave.<br><\/li><li>Endless waves: the horde never stops.<br><\/li><li><strong>3 vs 3<\/strong>: you and two allies against three rivals, with troops that level up, bosses with abilities and fog of war. Plus two minigames: <strong>Color War<\/strong> (your towers paint the enemy's ground) and <strong>Conquest<\/strong> (enclose territory with your creature).<br><\/li><li>Adaptive music that rises with the battle.<br><\/li><li>74 achievements.<br><\/li><li>Playable tutorial, 4 game speeds and manual slow motion.<br><\/li><li>10 languages, rebindable keys, controller support and accessibility options (text size, colorblind filters, fewer flashes).<\/li><\/ul>","short_description":"A maze-building tower defense against hordes of thousands. Raise walls, build 15 kinds of defenses, pick a card every wave and unlock a 562-upgrade skill tree. Slow-motion missiles, a boss every wave and endless waves: how far can you go?","supported_languages":"English, French, German, Spanish - Spain, Simplified Chinese, Korean, Japanese, Polish, Portuguese - Brazil, Russian","header_image":"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5367330\/a3fca76e783dfc75b3fc2a5bed7191ead64f5eb7\/header.jpg?t=1793641576","capsule_image":"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5367330\/28e44debbcf825e90ee8d72266d99d39ef7fbfd8\/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1793641576","capsule_imagev5":"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5367330\/28e44debbcf825e90ee8d72266d99d39ef7fbfd8\/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1793641576","website":null,"pc_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:<\/strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system<br><\/li><li><strong>OS:<\/strong> Windows 10 64-bit<br><\/li><li><strong>Processor:<\/strong> Dual-core 2 GHz<br><\/li><li><strong>Memory:<\/strong> 4 GB RAM<br><\/li><li><strong>Graphics:<\/strong> OpenGL 3.3 compatible, integrated graphics<br><\/li><li><strong>Storage:<\/strong> 300 MB available space<br><\/li><li><strong>Additional Notes:<\/strong> Internet connection only needed for online 3v3 multiplayer.<\/li><\/ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:<\/strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system<br><\/li><li><strong>OS:<\/strong> Windows 10\/11 64-bit<br><\/li><li><strong>Processor:<\/strong> Quad-core 3 GHz<br><\/li><li><strong>Memory:<\/strong> 8 GB RAM<br><\/li><li><strong>Graphics:<\/strong> Dedicated GPU with OpenGL 3.3 support<br><\/li><li><strong>Storage:<\/strong> 300 MB available space<br><\/li><li><strong>Additional Notes:<\/strong> Internet connection only needed for online 3v3 multiplayer.<\/li><\/ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:<\/strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:<\/strong> macOS 10.13 (Intel) \/ macOS 11 (Apple Silicon)<br><\/li><li><strong>Processor:<\/strong> Intel Core i5 or Apple M1<br><\/li><li><strong>Memory:<\/strong> 4 GB RAM<br><\/li><li><strong>Graphics:<\/strong> OpenGL 3.3 compa